My recommendation

For your specific Chama project, I would start with:

FastAPI + PostgreSQL + Jenga + M-Pesa

Then architect the code so we can later add:

KCB BUNI + NCBA + other bank providers

without rewriting the Chama system.

That gives you a realistic path:

